    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🟨 1. PROBLEM\n## Customer Complaint Management Automation\n\n  ### Manually reading, categorizing, routing, recording, and replying to customer complaints is time-consuming and can cause delays or errors.\n\n## 🟨 2. BUSINESS USE CASE\n### Automatically processes customer emails and routes complaints to the appropriate team.\n\n### Example:\n### Delivery → Delivery Team\n### Refund → Refund Team\n### Product → Product Support\n### Other → General Support\n\n## 🟨 3. WHERE IT CAN BE USED\n### E-commerce\n### Banking & FinTech\n### Insurance\n### Telecom\n### Travel & Hospitality\n### SaaS / Technology\n## 🟨 4. KEY BENEFITS\n### Reduces manual work\n### Faster complaint routing\n### Consistent processing\n### Centralized complaint records\n### Automatic team notification\n### Automatic customer acknowledgment\n## 🟨 5. WORKFLOW\n### Email → AI Extraction → IF → Switch → Department → Merge → Google Sheets → Internal Email → Customer Reply\n\n### IF:\n### Complaint → Continue\n### Not Complaint → Stop\n\n## 🟨 6. NODE PURPOSE\n### Information Extractor → Extracts complaint details\n### IF → Checks complaint/non-complaint\n### Switch → Routes complaint type\n### Edit Fields → Sets team, priority & status\n### Merge → Combines branches\n### Google Sheets → Logs complaint\n### Gmail → Notifies team + replies to customer\n## 🟨 7. AI EXTRACTION\n### AI extracts:\n\n### Customer Name\n### Customer Email\n### Complaint\n### Complaint Type\n### Order ID\n### Priority\n## 🟨 8. ROUTING LOGIC\n### 🚚 Delivery → Delivery & Logistics\n### 💰 Refund → Refund & Payments\n### 📦 Product → Product Support\n###❓ Other → General Customer Support\n\n## 🟨 9. OUTPUT / RESULT\n### Every complaint produces:\n\n### Structured Record + Team Notification + Customer Acknowledgment\n\n## End Result:\n### A faster, structured, and automated first-level complaint management process.",
        "height": 2144,
        "width": 1168,
        "color": 4
      },
